0079 / 900079 | 使用者家目錄權限 / 700或更低權限 | 基本項目 / 83 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄權限：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    dirperm=$(ls -ld $dir &#124; cut -f1 -d\\\" \\\")<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c5) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Group Read permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c6) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Group Write permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c7) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Group Execute permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c8) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Other Read permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c9) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Other Write permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>    if [ $(echo $dirperm &#124; cut -c10) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\"Other Execute permission set on the home directory ($dir) of user $user\\\"<br>    fi<br>  fi<br>done<br>若出現群組具寫入權限，其他使用者具讀取、寫入及執行權限之家目錄，則可執行以下指令，變更目錄權限為700或更低權限：<br>#chmod 700 /home/(使用者帳號名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源互動帳號集合，排除 halt/sync/shutdown 名稱前綴與 nologin/false；700位元子集，家目錄不限/home。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:48:| TWGCB-01-012-0080 / 900080 | 使用者家目錄擁有者 / 使用者擁有 | 基本項目 / 84 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄擁有者：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    owner=$(stat -L -c \\\"%U\\\" \\\"$dir\\\")<br>    if [ \\\"$owner\\\" != \\\"$user\\\" ]; then<br>  echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user is owned by $owner.\\\"<br>  fi<br>fi<br>done<br>若出現使用者之家目錄非使用者擁有，則可執行以下指令，變更家目錄擁有者為使用者：<br>#chown (使用者帳號名稱) /home/(使用者帳號名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源 passwd 家目錄與 UID；跟隨stat symlink；缺目錄失敗。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:49:| TWGCB-01-012-0081 / 900081 | 使用者家目錄擁有群組 / 使用者群組擁有 | 基本項目 / 85 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄之擁有群組GID：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $4 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user gid dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    owner=$(stat -L -c \\\"%g\\\" \\\"$dir\\\")<br>    if [ \\\"$owner\\\" != \\\"$gid\\\" ]; then<br>  echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of group $gid is owned by group $owner.\\\"<br>  fi<br>fi<br>done<br>若出現使用者家目錄非使用者群組所擁有，則可執行以下指令，變更家目錄擁有者為使用者群組：<br>#chgrp (使用者群組名稱或GID) /home/(使用者帳號名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源 passwd 家目錄與主要GID；缺目錄失敗。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:50:| TWGCB-01-012-0082 / 900082 | 使用者家目錄之「.」檔案權限 / go-w或更低權限 | 基本項目 / 86 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄之「.」檔案權限：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    for file in $dir/.[A-Za-z0-9]*; do<br>      if [ ! -h \\\"$file\\\" -a -f \\\"$file\\\" ]; then<br>        fileperm=$(ls -ld $file &#124; cut -f1 -d\\\" \\\")<br>        if [ $(echo $fileperm &#124; cut -c6) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>          echo \\\"Group Write permission set on file $file\\\"<br>        fi<br>        if [ $(echo $fileperm &#124; cut -c9) != \\\"-\\\" ]; then<br>          echo \\\"Other Write permission set on file $file\\\"<br>        fi<br>      fi<br>    done<br>  fi<br>done<br>若出現具有world-writable或group-writable權限之「.」檔案，則可執行以下指令，移除群組與其他身分之寫入權限或更低權限：<br>#chmod go-w (檔案名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源只查家目錄一層 .[A-Za-z0-9]* 普通檔、排除symlink、禁022；找到即返回。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:51:| TWGCB-01-012-0083 / 900083 | 使用者家目錄之「.forward」檔案 / 移除 | 基本項目 / 87 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄是否存在「.forward」檔案：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(root&#124;halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    if [ ! -h \\\"$dir/.forward\\\" -a -f \\\"$dir/.forward\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\".forward file $dir/.forward exists\\\"<br>    fi<br>  fi<br>done<br>若存在「.forward」檔案，則可執行以下指令移除檔案：<br>#rm (檔案名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.forward；未擴張成含root，待批。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:52:| TWGCB-01-012-0084 / 900084 | 使用者家目錄之「.netrc」檔案 / 移除 | 基本項目 / 88 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄是否存在「.netrc」檔案：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(root&#124;halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    if [ ! -h \\\"$dir/.netrc\\\" -a -f \\\"$dir/.netrc\\\" ]; then<br>      echo \\\".netrc file $dir/.netrc exists\\\"<br>    fi<br>  fi<br>done<br>若存在「.netrc」檔案，則可執行以下指令移除檔案：<br>#rm (檔案名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.netrc；未讀檔案內容，待批。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:53:| TWGCB-01-012-0085 / 900085 | 使用者家目錄之「.rhosts」檔案 / 移除 | 基本項目 / 89 | 開啟終端機，執行以下腳本，檢查每個使用者家目錄是否存在「.rhosts」檔案：<br>#!/bin/bash<br>grep -E -v '^(root&#124;halt&#124;sync&#124;shutdown)' /etc/passwd &#124; awk -F: '($7 != \\\"/sbin/nologin\\\" &amp;&amp; $7 != \\\"/bin/false\\\") { print $1 \\\" \\\" $6 }' &#124; while read user dir; do<br>  if [ ! -d \\\"$dir\\\" ]; then<br>    echo \\\"The home directory ($dir) of user $user does not exist.\\\"<br>  else<br>    for file in $dir/.rhosts; do<br>      if [ ! -h \\\"$file\\\" -a -f \\\"$file\\\" ]; then<br>        echo \\\".rhosts file in $dir\\\"<br>      fi<br>    done<br>  fi<br>done<br>若存在「.rhosts」檔案，則可執行以下指令移除檔案：<br>#rm (檔案名稱)<br>注意：請先通知使用者再變更家目錄相關設定，以避免影響使用者作業 | 依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.rhosts，待批。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:60:| TWGCB-01-012-0303 / 900303 | /etc/security/opasswd與 /etc/security/opasswd.old檔案所有權 / root:root | 基本項目 / 263 | 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，設定/etc/security/opasswd與/etc/security/opasswd.old檔案所有權：<br>#chown root:root /etc/security/opasswd /etc/security/opasswd.old | 來源無缺檔豁免；opasswd與.old都必須存在且root:root，不讀內容。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:61:| TWGCB-01-012-0304 / 900304 | /etc/security/opasswd與 /etc/security/opasswd.old檔案權限 / 644或更低權限 | 基本項目 / 264 | 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，設定/etc/security/opasswd與/etc/security/opasswd.old檔案權限為644或更低權限：<br>#chmod 644 /etc/security/opasswd /etc/security/opasswd.old | 來源無缺檔豁免；兩檔都必須存在且644位元子集。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:62:| TWGCB-01-012-0305 / 900305 | /etc/shells中不應存在nologin / 移除含有nologin的行 | 基本項目 / 265 | 開啟終端機，執行以下指令，尋找/etc/shells中是否含有nologin：<br>#grep -E '^[^#]*\\\\/nologin$' /etc/shells<br>開啟終端機，執行vim指令在/etc/shells移除含有nologin的行，範例如下：<br>#vim /etc/shells | 排除註解與前後空白後禁止/nologin結尾。P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。 |\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:81:- 0079–0082：照來源passwd帳號與家目錄集合，排除halt/sync/shutdown名稱前綴與/sbin/nologin、/bin/false；包含root，不自行只限/home/*。0079採700位元子集，0080/81比UID/主要GID；缺家目錄失敗。0082只讀一層.[A-Za-z0-9]*普通檔metadata，略過symlink，不遞迴。\\n./docs/P2B7_REVIEW.md:84:- 0303/0304：來源沒有缺檔豁免，opasswd和opasswd.old兩者必須存在；缺檔不PASS。只讀metadata，完全不讀opasswd內容。0305排除註解與空白後禁/nologin結尾。0306檢查OPTIONS含-F 2且無-u root；實際執行身分與重啟生效待審。\\n./linuxgcb/p2b6_runtime.py:90:            if t[0] not in ('sync', 'shutdown', 'halt') and t[6] not in ('/sbin/nologin', '/usr/sbin/nologin', '/bin/false'):\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n./codex_fix6.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_5\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"cat linuxgcb/batch7.py; cat tests/test_fix5.py; cat tests/test_p2b7.py; rg -n 'nologin|opasswd|def users|n == 30[34]' linuxgcb/p2b7_runtime.py; cat linuxgcb/__main__.py\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"P2B7 source-bound offline candidates, direct w_strtok Python argv.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport inspect\\nimport hashlib\\nfrom zipfile import ZipFile\\nfrom xml.etree import ElementTree as ET\\nfrom functools import lru_cache\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom . import p2b7_runtime\\nfrom .argv import quote_argument\\nADDED = {32} | set(range(34,45)) | set(range(61,92)) | set(range(303,308))\\n\\n\\n@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\\ndef sources():\\n    from scripts.inventory import extract\\n    root = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]\\n    docx = root/'docs/references/gcb-rhel9-v1.2.docx'\\n    if hashlib.sha256(docx.read_bytes()).hexdigest() != '986effd9501b1fd97776129c6691cf8fc98246bd04514347322f3337508e0e5b':\\n        raise ValueError('GCB v1.2 reference hash changed')\\n    ns = {'w':'http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main'}\\n    xml = ET.fromstring(ZipFile(docx).read('word/document.xml'))\\n    tables = [['\\\\n'.join(''.join(t.text or '' for t in p.findall('.//w:t',ns))\\n              for p in cell.findall('.//w:p',ns)) for cell in tr.findall('w:tc',ns)]\\n              for tr in xml.findall('.//w:tr',ns)]\\n    out = {}\\n    for r in extract(next(root.glob('*.xlsx'))):\\n        n = int(r['gcb_id'][-4:])\\n        if n not in ADDED:\\n            continue\\n        matches = [c for c in tables if r['gcb_id'] in c and c[-1] == r['expected'] and c[-2] == r['configuration_method']]\\n        if not matches or any(c[-2:] != matches[0][-2:] for c in matches):\\n            raise ValueError('GCB DOCX/XLSX source mismatch: '+r['gcb_id'])\\n        out[n] = dict(r, configuration_method=matches[0][-2])\\n    if set(out) != ADDED:\\n        raise ValueError('incomplete P2B7 source set')\\n    return out\\n\\n\\ndef script(n):\\n    return inspect.getsource(p2b7_runtime) + '\\\\ntry:\\\\n    ok = check(' + str(n) + \\\")\\\\nexcept (OSError, ValueError, IndexError, KeyError, subprocess.SubprocessError):\\\\n    ok = False\\\\nif ok:\\\\n    print('PASS')\\\\n\\\"\\n\\n\\n@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\\ndef rules():\\n    return {n:[('c:/usr/bin/python3 -c ' + quote_argument(script(n)), '^PASS$')] for n in sorted(ADDED)}\\n\\n\\ndef mechanism(n):\\n    return '逐條來源唯讀 predicate；直接 python3 -c argv；單一 PASS commit'\\n\\n\\ndef caveat(n):\\n    notes = {\\n        32:'main 與 repo 檔同查 gpgcheck/localpkg_gpgcheck=1；各repo section皆需雙key；繼承與生效待批。',\\n        34:'只接受未限定 Defaults use_pty；限定使用者/主機、include、續行與覆寫待審。',\\n        35:'logfile 要求非空絕對路徑；來源 /var/log/sudo.log 僅範例；複雜 sudoers 語意待審。',\\n        36:'定向 rpm -q aide 三態；初始化資料庫動作未執行，資料庫生效另審。',\\n        37:'來源 root crontab 每天5點；expected 每天允許合法固定分時；依任務另接受 cron.daily 可執行檔明確 /usr/sbin/aide --check。排程替代需批。',\\n        38:'來源 BIOS grub.cfg/grubenv/選用user.cfg；UEFI fstab uid=0,gid=0；未自行增加 loader/entries。',\\n        39:'來源 BIOS 600 位元子集；UEFI fmask=0177；未自行增加 loader/entries。',\\n        40:'靜態確認 grub2-setpassword 產生之 user.cfg PBKDF2 宣告；grub.cfg 載入與重建效果留真機。',\\n        41:'來源 rescue/emergency.service ExecStart 精確比對；systemd drop-in 實際生效留真機。',\\n        42:'同查 suid_dumpable=0、core_pattern=|/bin/false 與 * hard core 0；條件性 coredump Storage/ProcessSizeMax/mask、即時值與載入效力待人工證據。',\\n        43:'持久設定 randomize_va_space 精確2；即時值待真機。',\\n        44:'來源明列 /etc/crypto-policies/config FUTURE/FIPS；未改查 CURRENT.pol；生效/重開機待真機。',\\n        68:'來源 find 允許 root/tty/slocate/lock，但 expected 寫 root；依方法保留四群組，待批。',\\n        72:'shadow 只判空欄；!/* 為非空鎖定；不輸出帳號/雜湊。',\\n        73:'來源 echo $PATH；離線靜態讀 /etc/profile、/root/.bash_profile、.bashrc 的 literal PATH，受限展開 $PATH；拒絕動態語法；登入環境與其他載入來源待批。',\\n        74:'沿用0073靜態PATH子集，逐目錄確認存在且無022寫入位元；登入有效環境待批。',\\n        79:'依來源互動帳號集合，排除 halt/sync/shutdown 名稱前綴與 nologin/false；700位元子集，家目錄不限/home。',\\n        80:'依來源 passwd 家目錄與 UID；跟隨stat symlink；缺目錄失敗。',\\n        81:'依來源 passwd 家目錄與主要GID；缺目錄失敗。',\\n        82:'依來源只查家目錄一層 .[A-Za-z0-9]* 普通檔、排除symlink、禁022；找到即返回。',\\n        83:'依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.forward；未擴張成含root，待批。',\\n        84:'依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.netrc；未讀檔案內容，待批。',\\n        85:'依來源排除root/halt/sync/shutdown前綴，只禁非symlink普通.rhosts，待批。',\\n        86:'passwd 所有主要GID需存在於本機group；NSS遠端群組不推測。',\\n        87:'UID以整數唯一性判定。',88:'GID以整數唯一性判定。',\\n        91:'要求shadow群組存在、補充成員空且無passwd主要GID引用；缺群組保守失敗，待批。',\\n        303:'來源無缺檔豁免；opasswd與.old都必須存在且root:root，不讀內容。',\\n        304:'來源無缺檔豁免；兩檔都必須存在且644位元子集。',\\n        305:'排除註解與前後空白後禁止/nologin結尾。',\\n        306:'來源OPTIONS含-F 2且不得-u root；服務執行身分/重啟生效留真機。',\\n        307:'來源ptrace_scope精確1，未自行放寬2/3；即時值待真機。',\\n    }.get(n,'依來源本機帳號檔唯讀解析。')\\n    if 61 <= n <= 71:\\n        notes += 'find -xdev、pseudo prune、-print -quit；0061–65依mountinfo逐本機磁區，0066–71固定來源目錄；24秒整體子程序預算，錯誤/逾時無PASS。分區範圍/白名單待真機。'\\n    return notes + 'P2B7 UNVALIDATED；human_review_pending；execution_review=blocked；來源文字靜態唯讀子集，生效狀態/角色/覆寫需真機；缺失與錯誤無 PASS。'\\nfrom linuxgcb.batch7 import ADDED as BATCH7\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"FIX5: offline scope protection and synthetic rpm exit/output regression.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport json\\nimport hashlib\\nimport shlex\\nimport subprocess\\nimport unittest\\n\\nfrom linuxgcb.batch6 import ADDED as BATCH6\\nfrom linuxgcb.argv import w_strtok\\nfrom linuxgcb.catalog import ROOT, digest\\nfrom linuxgcb.policy import parse_rule, simulate\\n\\n\\nclass Fix5Tests(unittest.TestCase):\\n    def test_only_900188_rules_changed_and_evidence_preserved(self):\\n        before = json.loads((ROOT/'tests/fix5_baseline.json').read_text())\\n        old = {c['id']: c for c in before['checks']}\\n        current = {c['id']: c for p in (ROOT/'policies').glob('*.yml')\\n                   for c in json.loads(p.read_text())['checks']}\\n        self.assertEqual(len(current), 236)\\n        current = {n:c for n,c in current.items() if n in old}\\n        self.assertEqual(old.keys(), current.keys())\\n        self.assertEqual({n for n in old if old[n]['rules'] != current[n]['rules']}, {900188})\\n        for n in old:\\n            actual = dict(current[n])\\n            if n == 900188:\\n                actual['rules'] = old[n]['rules']\\n            self.assertEqual(actual, old[n])\\n        for name, sha in before['protected_hashes'].items():\\n            if name in ('data/scope_registry.json', 'data/coverage_manifest.json'):\\n                original = subprocess.check_output(['git', 'show', 'd2bd3ae:'+name], cwd=ROOT)\\n                self.assertEqual(hashlib.sha256(original).hexdigest(), sha, name)\\n                prior = json.loads(original)\\n                now = json.loads((ROOT/name).read_text())\\n                if name.endswith('scope_registry.json'):\\n                    self.assertEqual([r for r in prior if r['sca_id']-900000 not in BATCH6 | BATCH7],\\n                                     [r for r in now if r['sca_id']-900000 not in BATCH6 | BATCH7])\\n                else:\\n                    self.assertEqual(prior['reviewed'], [r for r in now['reviewed'] if r['sca_id']-900000 not in BATCH6 | BATCH7])\\n            else:\\n                self.assertEqual(digest(ROOT/name), sha, name)\\n        for p in (ROOT/'policies').glob('*.yml'):\\n            self.assertIn('UNVALIDATED', json.loads(p.read_text())['policy']['name'])\\n\\n    def test_exact_tristate_argv_and_buffered_large_output(self):\\n        check = next(c for c in json.loads((ROOT/'policies/linuxgcb_base.yml').read_text())['checks']\\n                     if c['id'] == 900188)\\n        body = ('out=$(rpm -q setroubleshoot 2>/dev/null); rc=$?; case $rc in '\\n                '0) echo INSTALLED;; 1) echo ABSENT;; *) exit $rc;; esac')\\n        self.assertEqual(check['rules'], ['c:/bin/sh -c \\\"'+body+'\\\" -> r:^ABSENT$'])\\n        target, _ = parse_rule(check['rules'][0])\\n        self.assertEqual(w_strtok(target[2:]), ['/bin/sh', '-c', body])\\n        prefix = 'out=$(rpm -q setroubleshoot 2>/dev/null)'\\n        # Replace the complete rpm query; execute only synthetic printf/exit.\\n        for rc in (0, 1, 2, 3, 126, 127):\\n            with self.subTest(rc=rc):\\n                payload = 'ABSENT\\\\n'*500+'LINUXGCB_COMMAND_OK\\\\n'\\n                fake = 'printf %s '+shlex.quote(payload)+'; exit '+str(rc)\\n                result = subprocess.run(['/bin/sh', '-c', 'out=$('+fake+')'+body[len(prefix):]],\\n                                        capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)\\n                expected = 'INSTALLED\\\\n' if rc == 0 else 'ABSENT\\\\n' if rc == 1 else ''\\n                self.assertEqual(result.stdout, expected)\\n                self.assertEqual(result.returncode, 0 if rc in (0, 1) else rc)\\n                self.assertEqual(simulate(check, {target: dict(stdout=result.stdout, exit_code=result.returncode)}),\\n                                 'PASS' if rc == 1 else 'FAIL')\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"P2B7 isolated source predicates; no host configuration or scans are executed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport contextlib\\nimport io\\nimport json\\nimport os\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport subprocess\\nimport tempfile\\nimport unittest\\nfrom unittest.mock import patch\\nfrom linuxgcb import batch7, p2b7_runtime as rt\\nfrom linuxgcb.argv import w_strtok\\nfrom linuxgcb.catalog import ROOT\\nfrom linuxgcb.coverage import manifest\\n\\n\\nclass P2B7Tests(unittest.TestCase):\\n    def setUp(self):\\n        self.tmp = tempfile.TemporaryDirectory()\\n        self.addCleanup(self.tmp.cleanup)\\n        old = rt.ROOT\\n        rt.ROOT = self.tmp.name\\n        self.addCleanup(setattr, rt, 'ROOT', old)\\n\\n    def put(self, p, text='', mode=None):\\n        dest = Path(self.tmp.name+p)\\n        dest.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n        dest.write_text(text)\\n        if mode is not None: dest.chmod(mode)\\n        return dest\\n\\n    def tree(self):\\n        self.put('/etc/yum.conf','[main]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1')\\n        self.put('/etc/dnf/dnf.conf','[main]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1')\\n        self.put('/etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo','[local]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1')\\n        self.put('/etc/sudoers','Defaults use_pty, logfile=\\\"/var/log/sudo.log\\\"')\\n        self.put('/etc/cron.daily/aidecheck','#!/bin/bash\\\\n/usr/sbin/aide --check',0o700)\\n        self.put('/etc/fstab','')\\n        self.put('/boot/grub2/grub.cfg','',0o600)\\n        self.put('/boot/grub2/grubenv','',0o600)\\n        self.put('/boot/grub2/user.cfg','GRUB2_PASSWORD=grub.pbkdf2.sha512.10000.ABC.DEF',0o600)\\n        for name in ('rescue','emergency'):\\n            self.put('/usr/lib/systemd/system/'+name+'.service','[Service]\\\\nExecStart=-/usr/lib/systemd/systemd-sulogin-shell '+name)\\n        self.put('/etc/sysctl.conf','fs.suid_dumpable = 0\\\\nkernel.core_pattern = |/bin/false\\\\nkernel.randomize_va_space=2\\\\nkernel.yama.ptrace_scope=1')\\n        self.put('/etc/security/limits.conf','* hard core 0')\\n        self.put('/etc/crypto-policies/config','FUTURE # comment')\\n        self.put('/proc/self/mountinfo','1 0 8:1 / / rw - xfs /dev/test rw')\\n        self.put('/etc/passwd','root:x:0:0::/root:/bin/bash\\\\nuser:x:1000:1000::/home/user:/bin/bash')\\n        self.put('/etc/shadow','root:!:1:0:99999:7:::\\\\nuser:!:1:0:99999:7:::')\\n        self.put('/etc/group','root:x:0:\\\\nuser:x:1000:\\\\nshadow:x:42:')\\n        self.put('/etc/profile','PATH=\\\"/usr/bin:/usr/sbin\\\"\\\\nexport PATH')\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/usr/bin').mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/usr/sbin').mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/usr/bin').chmod(0o755)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/usr/sbin').chmod(0o755)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/root').mkdir(exist_ok=True)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/root').chmod(0o700)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/home/user').mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/home/user').chmod(0o700)\\n        self.put('/etc/security/opasswd','',0o644)\\n        self.put('/etc/security/opasswd.old','',0o644)\\n        self.put('/etc/shells','/bin/bash\\\\n# /sbin/nologin')\\n        self.put('/etc/sysconfig/chronyd','OPTIONS=\\\"-F 2\\\"')\\n\\n    def owner_stat(self, p, *args, **kwargs):\\n        st = list(self.real_stat(p,*args,**kwargs))\\n        user = str(p).startswith(self.tmp.name+'/home/user')\\n        st[4] = st[5] = 1000 if user else 0\\n        return os.stat_result(st)\\n\\n    def test_scope_source_argv_and_no_secret_output(self):\\n        self.assertEqual(len(batch7.ADDED),48)\\n        m = manifest()\\n        self.assertEqual((m['counts']['included'],m['counts']['excluded'],m['counts']['implemented']),(307,7,236))\\n        for n, rules in batch7.rules().items():\\n            self.assertEqual(batch7.sources()[n]['category'],'系統設定與維護')\\n            argv = w_strtok(rules[0][0][2:])\\n            self.assertEqual(argv[:2],['/usr/bin/python3','-c'])\\n            self.assertEqual(len(argv),3)\\n            self.assertEqual(argv[2],batch7.script(n))\\n            self.assertNotIn('->',argv[2])\\n            self.assertEqual(argv[2].count(\\\"print('PASS')\\\"),1)\\n            compile(argv[2],'<candidate>','exec')\\n\\n    def test_all_48_positive_and_single_commit(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.real_stat = os.stat\\n        with patch.object(rt.os,'stat',side_effect=self.owner_stat), patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',return_value=subprocess.CompletedProcess([],0,'','')) as run:\\n            for n in sorted(batch7.ADDED):\\n                if n == 36: run.return_value = subprocess.CompletedProcess([],0,'aide-test','')\\n                else: run.return_value = subprocess.CompletedProcess([],0,'','')\\n                program = batch7.script(n).replace(\\\"ROOT = ''\\\",'ROOT = '+repr(self.tmp.name),1)\\n                with contextlib.redirect_stdout(io.StringIO()) as out:\\n                    exec(program,{})\\n                self.assertEqual(out.getvalue(),'PASS\\\\n',n)\\n\\n    def test_all_missing_and_errors_never_commit(self):\\n        for n in batch7.ADDED:\\n            program = batch7.script(n).replace(\\\"ROOT = ''\\\",'ROOT = '+repr(self.tmp.name),1)\\n            with patch('subprocess.run',side_effect=OSError('offline')),contextlib.redirect_stdout(io.StringIO()) as out:\\n                exec(program,{})\\n            self.assertEqual(out.getvalue(),'',n)\\n        self.tree()\\n        for n in batch7.ADDED:\\n            with patch('builtins.open',side_effect=PermissionError),patch.object(rt.os,'stat',side_effect=PermissionError),patch('subprocess.run',side_effect=subprocess.TimeoutExpired('offline',1)),contextlib.redirect_stdout(io.StringIO()) as out:\\n                exec(batch7.script(n).replace(\\\"ROOT = ''\\\",'ROOT = '+repr(self.tmp.name),1),{})\\n            self.assertEqual(out.getvalue(),'',n)\\n\\n    def test_sysctl_numeric_boundary_comments_and_prefix(self):\\n        for n,key,good in [(42,'fs.suid_dumpable',0),(43,'kernel.randomize_va_space',2),(307,'kernel.yama.ptrace_scope',1)]:\\n            self.put('/etc/security/limits.conf','* hard core 0')\\n            extra='\\\\nkernel.core_pattern=|/bin/false' if n==42 else ''\\n            for text, expected in [(f' {key} = {good}  ',True),(f'# {key}={good}',False),(f'{key}_bad={good}',False),(f'{key}={good+1}',False),(f'{key}={good-1}',False)]:\\n                self.put('/etc/sysctl.conf',text+extra)\\n                self.assertEqual(rt.check(n),expected,(n,text))\\n        self.put('/etc/sysctl.conf','fs.suid_dumpable=0\\\\nkernel.core_pattern=|/bin/false')\\n        self.put('/etc/security/limits.conf','* hard core 1')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(42))\\n        self.put('/etc/sysctl.d/99-local.conf','fs.suid_dumpable=1')\\n        self.put('/etc/security/limits.conf','* hard core 0')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(42))\\n\\n    def test_rpm_three_states(self):\\n        for code, output, expected in [(0,'aide-1',True),(1,'not installed',False),(0,'',False)]:\\n            with patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',return_value=subprocess.CompletedProcess([],code,output,'')) as run:\\n                self.assertEqual(rt.check(36),expected)\\n                self.assertEqual(run.call_args.args[0],['/usr/bin/rpm','-q','aide'])\\n        with patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',return_value=subprocess.CompletedProcess([],2,'aide-1','')):\\n            with self.assertRaises(ValueError): rt.check(36)\\n\\n    def test_find_fail_fast_scope_and_error(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.put('/proc/self/mountinfo','1 0 8:1 / / rw - xfs /dev/test rw\\\\n2 0 8:2 / /home rw - ext4 /dev/test2 rw\\\\n3 0 0:1 / /proc rw - proc proc rw')\\n        for n in range(61,72):\\n            argv=rt.scan_argv(n,'/')\\n            self.assertIn('-xdev',argv)\\n            self.assertEqual(argv[-2:],['-print','-quit'])\\n            self.assertIn('-prune',argv)\\n            self.assertNotIn('-exec',argv)\\n            if n >= 66: self.assertNotIn(self.tmp.name+'/',argv)\\n            with patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',return_value=subprocess.CompletedProcess([],0,'/violation\\\\n','')) as run:\\n                self.assertFalse(rt.check(n))\\n                self.assertEqual(run.call_count,1)\\n                self.assertLessEqual(run.call_args.kwargs['timeout'],24)\\n            for code,out,err in [(0,'','denied'),(1,'',''),(0,'violation','')]:\\n                with patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',return_value=subprocess.CompletedProcess([],code,out,err)):\\n                    self.assertFalse(rt.check(n))\\n        with patch.object(rt.subprocess,'run',side_effect=subprocess.TimeoutExpired('find',24)), contextlib.redirect_stdout(io.StringIO()) as out:\\n            exec(batch7.script(61).replace(\\\"ROOT = ''\\\",'ROOT = '+repr(self.tmp.name),1),{})\\n        self.assertEqual(out.getvalue(),'')\\n\\n    def test_accounts_negative_and_lock(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.put('/etc/shadow','root::1:0:99:7:::')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(72))\\n        for field in ('!','!!','*','!locked'):\\n            self.put('/etc/shadow',f'root:{field}:1:0:99:7:::')\\n            self.assertTrue(rt.check(72))\\n        for n,p in [(75,'passwd'),(76,'shadow'),(77,'group')]:\\n            self.put('/etc/'+p,'+:\\\\n')\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(n))\\n        self.tree()\\n        for n,p,line in [(78,'passwd','evil:x:0:0::/root:/bin/bash'),(87,'passwd','other:x:1000:1000::/home/other:/bin/bash'),(88,'group','other:x:1000:'),(89,'passwd','user:x:1001:1000::/home/user:/bin/bash'),(90,'group','user:x:1001:')]:\\n            self.tree()\\n            self.put('/etc/'+p,rt.read('/etc/'+p)+'\\\\n'+line)\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(n),n)\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.put('/etc/group','root:x:0:\\\\nshadow:x:42:')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(86))\\n        self.put('/etc/group','root:x:0:\\\\nuser:x:1000:\\\\nshadow:x:42:user')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(91))\\n        self.put('/etc/group','root:x:0:\\\\nuser:x:1000:\\\\nshadow:x:42:')\\n        self.put('/etc/passwd','root:x:0:0::/root:/bin/bash\\\\nuser:x:1000:42::/home/user:/bin/bash')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(91))\\n\\n    def test_home_fail_fast_and_source_exclusions(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/home/user').chmod(0o750)\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(79))\\n        self.real_stat=os.stat\\n        with patch.object(rt.os,'stat',side_effect=self.owner_stat):\\n            self.assertTrue(rt.check(80)); self.assertTrue(rt.check(81))\\n        self.put('/home/user/.bashrc','',0o662)\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(82))\\n        for n,name in [(83,'.forward'),(84,'.netrc'),(85,'.rhosts')]:\\n            p=self.put('/home/user/'+name)\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(n))\\n            p.unlink()\\n            self.put('/root/'+name)\\n            self.assertTrue(rt.check(n)) # Source explicitly excludes root.\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/home/user/.bashrc').unlink()\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/home/user').rmdir()\\n        for n in range(79,86): self.assertFalse(rt.check(n),n)\\n\\n    def test_path_static_subset_and_permissions(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        for v in ('/bin::/sbin','.:/bin','../bin:/bin','bin:/bin','/bin/../sbin'):\\n            self.put('/etc/profile','PATH=\\\"'+v+'\\\"')\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(73),v)\\n        self.put('/etc/profile','PATH=\\\"/usr/bin:/usr/sbin\\\"')\\n        self.put('/root/.bashrc','PATH=\\\"$PATH:/root\\\"')\\n        self.assertTrue(rt.check(73));self.assertTrue(rt.check(74))\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/usr/bin').chmod(0o775)\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(74))\\n        self.put('/root/.bashrc','PATH=\\\"$PATH_SUFFIX\\\"')\\n        with self.assertRaises(ValueError): rt.check(73)\\n        self.put('/root/.bashrc','PATH=\\\"$(bad)\\\"')\\n        with self.assertRaises(ValueError): rt.check(73)\\n\\n    def test_source_config_negatives_and_opasswd_missing(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        for n,p,bad in [(32,'/etc/dnf/dnf.conf','[other]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1'),(34,'/etc/sudoers','# Defaults use_pty'),(35,'/etc/sudoers','Defaults logfile_bad=\\\"/log\\\"'),(37,'/etc/cron.daily/aidecheck','# /usr/sbin/aide --check'),(40,'/boot/grub2/user.cfg','GRUB2_PASSWORD='),(41,'/usr/lib/systemd/system/rescue.service','ExecStart=/bin/bash'),(44,'/etc/crypto-policies/config','DEFAULT'),(305,'/etc/shells','/sbin/nologin'),(306,'/etc/sysconfig/chronyd','OPTIONS=\\\"-F 2 -u root\\\"')]:\\n            self.put(p,bad)\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(n),n)\\n            self.tree()\\n        self.put('/var/spool/cron/root','0 5 * * * /usr/sbin/aide --check')\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/etc/cron.daily/aidecheck').unlink()\\n        self.assertTrue(rt.check(37))\\n        self.put('/var/spool/cron/root','0 25 * * * /usr/sbin/aide --check')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(37))\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/etc/security/opasswd.old').unlink()\\n        for n in (303,304):\\n            with contextlib.redirect_stdout(io.StringIO()) as out:\\n                exec(batch7.script(n).replace(\\\"ROOT = ''\\\",'ROOT = '+repr(self.tmp.name),1),{})\\n            self.assertEqual(out.getvalue(),'')\\n\\n    def test_chrony_options_conflicting_and_repeated(self):\\n        for options in ('-F 2 -F 0','-F 2 -u chrony -u root','-F 2 -uroot','-F 2 -u','-F 2 -F'):\\n            self.put('/etc/sysconfig/chronyd','OPTIONS=\\\"'+options+'\\\"')\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(306),options)\\n\\n    def test_repo_sections_and_owner_metadata(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.put('/etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo','[first]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1\\\\n[second]\\\\ngpgcheck=0\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(32))\\n        self.put('/etc/yum.repos.d/local.repo','[first]\\\\ngpgcheck=1\\\\nlocalpkg_gpgcheck=1\\\\n[second]\\\\ngpgcheck=1')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(32))\\n        self.real_stat=os.stat\\n        with patch.object(rt.os,'stat',side_effect=self.owner_stat):\\n            self.assertTrue(rt.check(38));self.assertTrue(rt.check(303))\\n        with patch.object(rt.os,'stat',return_value=os.stat_result((0o100600,0,0,1,1234,1234,0,0,0,0))):\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(38));self.assertFalse(rt.check(303))\\n            self.assertFalse(rt.check(80));self.assertFalse(rt.check(81))\\n\\n    def test_boot_branches_and_mode_bits(self):\\n        self.tree()\\n        self.put('/etc/fstab','UUID=example /boot/efi vfat uid=0,gid=0,fmask=0177 0 2')\\n        self.assertTrue(rt.check(38));self.assertTrue(rt.check(39))\\n        self.put('/etc/fstab','UUID=example /boot/efi vfat uid=0,gid=1,fmask=0077 0 2')\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(38));self.assertFalse(rt.check(39))\\n        self.put('/etc/fstab','')\\n        self.assertTrue(rt.check(39))\\n        Path(self.tmp.name+'/boot/grub2/grub.cfg').chmod(0o640)\\n        self.assertFalse(rt.check(39))\\n        for mode,expected in [(0o644,True),(0o600,True),(0o664,False),(0o1644,False)]:\\n            self.put('/etc/security/opasswd','',mode)\\n            self.assertEqual(rt.check(304),expected)\\n\\n    def test_original_188_rules_and_evidence_unchanged(self):\\n        old={};new={}\\n       